<title>NORWAY: Bergesen Q1 operating profit per division.</title>
<headline>Bergesen Q1 operating profit per division.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operating profit per division for Bergesen d.y. Group for the three months to March 31.</p>
<p>			    (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
